mstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/extras/1f7fca9be7f9800ffea95051a15ce38f.poster.avif?t=1738248761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/extras/1f7fca9be7f9800ffea95051a15ce38f.webm?t=1738248761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/extras/9415292c707711927f78ae939c0a1d2d.avif?t=1738248761\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a sea-worshiping world with whale gods, inspired by the landscapes and tales of Iceland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unearth Slavic-inspired myths brought to life through the stories you encounter on your travels. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/extras/21d1d1bc0074e65aba94d6428fd8e110.poster.avif?t=1738248761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/extras/21d1d1bc0074e65aba94d6428fd8e110.webm?t=1738248761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
